}, {"path": "/@kisaragipana/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/fa6bba74/uploads/origins/4a867c38-43d6-4b6f-9572-74306faf133d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f84a7bc78d435b98cb002724ba0c59ba", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fa6bba74/uploads/origins/4a867c38-43d6-4b6f-9572-74306faf133d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f84a7bc78d435b98cb002724ba0c59ba, https://si.imgix.net/fa6bba74/uploads/origins/4a867c38-43d6-4b6f-9572-74306faf133d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5b94154c1a4182d33aaf75ca84c5166e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fa6bba74/uploads/origins/4a867c38-43d6-4b6f-9572-74306faf133d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a3ef84ef4fc62976aafeede6aa4dabd3 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちわ！(｀・ω・´)ゞ私のff14のocの作業をお願いしたいのですが。\nhttps://sta.sh/24nivrnq0z8\n\n今までの作品と同じような作風でお願いしたいです。\nhttps://skeb.jp/@kisaragipana/works/1\nhttps://skeb.jp/@kisaragipana/works/9\n\nあなたの絵がとても好きなので、服装やポーズの最終決定はあなたにお願いしたいです。あなたがハッピーになるような絵を描いてください。\n\nこのキャラクターはおてんば娘で、嫌味な性格です。完成した作品を見るのが楽しみです。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kisaragipana/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e3f78433/uploads/origins/53b393d3-337d-4c36-b2cc-05a20c2f6551?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=21637ccf551c56379f341c9d8ad182ba", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e3f78433/uploads/origins/53b393d3-337d-4c36-b2cc-05a20c2f6551?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=21637ccf551c56379f341c9d8ad182ba, https://si.imgix.net/e3f78433/uploads/origins/53b393d3-337d-4c36-b2cc-05a20c2f6551?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dcbc70f08ed37087f2bdfb8e897d958c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e3f78433/uploads/origins/53b393d3-337d-4c36-b2cc-05a20c2f6551?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6704e06fc5afdb0c4bca6c7df38bad53 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "如月ぱな先生\n\n初めまして。私、個人VTuber活動をしております、風晶ロイシェと申します。(Twitter:@Husyoroisye)\n\nこの度は、Twitterでイラストを拝見致しまして、是非先生にイラストを描いて頂きたく、ご依頼させて頂きました。\n\n以下、イラストの内容です。\n・キャラクターは風晶ロイシェを希望致します。(現在使用している青モデル、詳しくは資料URLからご覧下さい)\n\n・ポーズ、衣装は先生にお任せできればと存じます。\n\n・もし可能であれば、C100にてA4サイズの同人誌を出す予定なのですが、そちらへのイラスト掲載、そのためのPSDファイル\n(掲載時には必ず先生のお名前とTwitterIDを記載致します)\n\n・その他、グッズへの商用利用許可も頂けると嬉しいです。\n\n(資料URL https://twitter.com/Husyoroisye/status/1513578767385387009?t=Huzu9X2SllVCp3Zq8f7GBQ&s=19)", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kisaragipana/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/aefd829d/uploads/origins/4109666b-0759-4242-b749-4f159e1cc95c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c19815d2ebabdf393687e00910ff8bd4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/aefd829d/uploads/origins/4109666b-0759-4242-b749-4f159e1cc95c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c19815d2ebabdf393687e00910ff8bd4, https://si.imgix.net/aefd829d/uploads/origins/4109666b-0759-4242-b749-4f159e1cc95c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eb7045be9f2d245d8fecd0b0ebac6dde 2x, https://si.imgix.net/aefd829d/uploads/origins/4109666b-0759-4242-b749-4f159e1cc95c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9af1793b518e6f481bbb226bb882deee 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "This is the order for the live2d model, thanks a bunch.\n\nHere are 2 general reference photos I commissioned, I want the age to look a little younger though (like some photos I will link later): \nhttps://ibb.co/dm3yjp1\nhttps://ibb.co/3k5nYBP\nIt is a boy just so you know lol 🤣\n\nAs for the costume, I want it like this https://ibb.co/1n2wvT3  except a little rough and one arm exposed with string/bandages around it like this https://ibb.co/mSF2jYC I also like the hair ornaments in that one.\n\nShould be mostly based in black and purple  like the original pictures.\nThe character is based on this creature https://ibb.co/cD8bKB6 which is called a \"phantom\" from \"animal jam classic\"\nAge should be like \"Kazuha\" from \"Genshin impact.\"", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kisaragipana/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/08c149c5/uploads/origins/6ca927db-5053-480e-96e5-78f9aad1de99?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=957a0687687f727de3616ae46d274d05", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/08c149c5/uploads/origins/6ca927db-5053-480e-96e5-78f9aad1de99?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=957a0687687f727de3616ae46d274d05, https://si.imgix.net/08c149c5/uploads/origins/6ca927db-5053-480e-96e5-78f9aad1de99?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bba9538ccc61afbbbaeb788f71b9838b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/08c149c5/uploads/origins/6ca927db-5053-480e-96e5-78f9aad1de99?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=932d28127bd21efc529519bbb8e66cff 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "如月ぱな様\n\nごまたかなと申します。\nホロライブ1期生のさくらみこのイラストをお願いしたいです。\n\n衣装は新巫女服か私服（↓のURLの2-3番目のデザイン）でお願いしたいです。\nhttps://hololive.hololivepro.com/talents/sakuramiko/\nそれ以外の構図などはお任せします。\n\n是非検討よろしくお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kisaragipana/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ee500487/uploads/origins/9dc7b09c-408c-4eff-91dd-d23a4e718c47?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1015168005bd482e579ccf0cc73e5d8c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ee500487/uploads/origins/9dc7b09c-408c-4eff-91dd-d23a4e718c47?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1015168005bd482e579ccf0cc73e5d8c, https://si.imgix.net/ee500487/uploads/origins/9dc7b09c-408c-4eff-91dd-d23a4e718c47?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bb1df2ffbf5caffafbbef9e21121a935 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ee500487/uploads/origins/9dc7b09c-408c-4eff-91dd-d23a4e718c47?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d9dc5202d09ac667f35d34e98f690db1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "初めまして。\nアークナイツのパラスをお願いできないでしょうか。\nシチュエーション等細かい指定はございません。\nご検討いただけますと幸いです。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kisaragipana/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/0b981ba7/uploads/origins/4daf95f9-38f5-4ab3-abc2-c43ae781ad30?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=198d1e75b1cf70e777457d0714eabd1d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0b981ba7/uploads/origins/4daf95f9-38f5-4ab3-abc2-c43ae781ad30?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=198d1e75b1cf70e777457d0714eabd1d, https://si.imgix.net/0b981ba7/uploads/origins/4daf95f9-38f5-4ab3-abc2-c43ae781ad30?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=705774b9c7d3d4a13942534c8311ada7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0b981ba7/uploads/origins/4daf95f9-38f5-4ab3-abc2-c43ae781ad30?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=3e1c107443efe830fa817eac262f294a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kisaragipana/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5374b1f7/uploads/origins/6a58b852-b7ae-49e8-b322-7ac38d0c5aea?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&tx